WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:06.020
(Dusk) I still think on that creature from the Abyss that preyed upon me.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.040
my faculties were far from lucid,

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.740
but I quite clearly sensed certain emotions.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:18.960
A wrenching nostalgia, a lost joy, an object of obsession

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.580
and a sincere hope to reclaim it.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.380
Could these thoughts belong to the beast from the Abyss?

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:32.520
But if that were true, then perhaps it is no beast after all.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.980
(Vaati) Four queens remain in empty kingdoms,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.320
all of them fragments of this creature

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.260
that was vanquished long ago.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:43.940
We have seen examples of their evil in what remains.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:47.120
One stands alone in the ruins of her home,

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:49.920
another rose from the ashes of a lost kingdom,

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.740
and yet another gained the love of her king

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:55.180
and used it to force him into a dark corner

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.940
where he would forever think on his mistakes.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:02.040
But you will hear the tale of a fourth queen before the end of this story,

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:06.720
and she will make you question everything that you previously held true.

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:12.460
Alsanna, Queen of the Ivory King, also stands alone in an empty kingdom.

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:18.560
(Alsanna) You... Approaching Eleum Loyce...

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.940
Turn back...

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:25.940
This dead city has nothing to offer...

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:27.940
Go back...

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:34.280
Do not seek the Old Chaos... Nor its twisted flame...

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:37.380
(Vaati) Why do we build walls? Well there are two reasons.

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:41.320
The first is more common. It's to protect something precious.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:45.680
But the second is much more rare and much more terrifying.

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.300
It's to keep something from getting out.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.900
The walls of Eleum Loyce are those second kind of walls.

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:57.420
The city is a Pandora's box, built to contain one of the most ancient evils the world ever knew.

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:59.140
The Chaos.

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.820
The Chaos did not always exist.

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:06.200
It was born of fear and desperation long ago in the Age of Lords.

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:08.980
Theirs was the earliest civilization

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:11.400
built upon the first Flame ever to be.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:16.640
Four powerful beings derived their strength from this Flame for it gave them souls.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:21.560
One soul of Dark, one of Light, a soul of Death and a soul of Life.

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:26.440
Inevitably, this first Flame began to dwindle and so too did the Lords.

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:29.540
The Witch of Izalith, with great power over flame,

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.300
thought to focus the power of her Life soul

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:33.820
to create a New Flame.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:36.820
A second Flame that could replace the First

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:39.240
so that their Age would not end.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:42.340
So the Witch and her daughters initiated this ritual.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:43.840
But something went wrong.

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:46.740
The Flame she created was too powerful

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:48.700
and she failed to control it.

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:51.200
This was the birth of Chaos.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:54.540
The Witch and her sisters [daughters] were either killed or malformed

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:57.200
and the Witch herself became the Bed of all Chaos

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:01.320
deep below Izalith, a city lost to the twisted Flame.

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:05.100
Countless demons spewed forth from the inextinguishable Chaos

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:08.500
infesting Izalith until the land was overrun.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.720
Lifetimes later, the Bed of Chaos would be defeated

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:12.980
but not destroyed.

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:16.120
And after the rise and fall of many civilizations,

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:17.480
the Chaos rose again

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:19.200
in the country of Forossa,

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:23.180
on a barren plain where Eleum Loyce was to be built.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:26.220
The Forossans were the ones who dealt with the Chaos

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:28.220
for it had erupted on their land.

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:33.220
Forossans are famed for their god of war valuing valor and combat prowess.

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:36.560
Notable men of Forossa were Shieldless Lothian

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:41.340
who grew tired of the frailty of human foes and set off to slay dragons.

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:47.020
There was Vengarl, the mad beast of the battlefield, who claimed the heads of countless enemies.

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:49.480
And there were the Forossan Lion Knights

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:52.160
feared for their nimble two-handed swordplay.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:55.680
But the highest ranking knight, and the most famed of them all

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:58.100
was the Ivory King of Forossa.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:03.080
After taking his crown, they say he was the first to swing his sword in times of need.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.940
Be it for his homeland or for his people.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:08.800
And his sword was required far to the north

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:12.320
for the Old Chaos had resurfaced there once more.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:20.360
(Alsanna) This land is barren, cursed by the Old Chaos...

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:27.660
It gave birth to atrocities and the people fled in fear...

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:34.640
Until our lord the Ivory King came...

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:37.840
(Vaati) With his sword, his soul and his Loyce knights,

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:40.220
the Ivory King fought back the Chaos.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:45.300
When it was contained, they built Eleum Loyce; a vast rampart city.

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:49.040
Golems patrolled the walls, given life by the Ivory King.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:52.940
They were charged with the containment of the creatures of the Chaos within.

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:59.540
A cult of priestesses was formed who devoted themselves to a ritual that appeased the ancient Flame.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:03.620
The King himself erected his throne at the very entrance to Chaos

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:06.600
for he wished to serve as the first line of defense.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:10.800
Any creature of Chaos that threatened his city would have to pass him first,

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.820
and the King would not falter.

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:18.300
It was here in Eleum Loyce that the Ivory King took a queen, Alsanna.

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.820
It appears she was a woman of great power,

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:24.200
for she possessed the same talent as the priestesses did

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:26.520
and she quelled the Chaos Flame below.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:29.720
Together, in a city cut off from the rest of the world

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.580
and facing constant peril,

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:35.160
they were wed and they stood together despite the hardship.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:39.160
Like the other queens before her, Alsanna was born of Dark.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:41.860
She wed her king out of selfishness

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.720
for she saw that the King of Forossa was strong

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:48.080
and intended to find safety by his side.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.700
Nevertheless, the Ivory King loved her

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:54.040
and supported this child of the Abyss even as he fought

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.280
against the Flames of Chaos.

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:58.680
Two ancient evils weighed upon the King.

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:01.240
One in front of him, and one at his side.

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:03.580
But even so, he weathered them both-

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:06.400
for himself and for his people.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:10.140
There is evidence that having a child of Dark by his side

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:11.480
weighed upon the King.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:16.220
He had seven pets, and two are found in the Outskirts of Eleum Loyce

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:20.500
tasked with the mercy killings of those who were exiled from the city.

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.400
Lud and Zallen are great cats.

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:27.020
Brothers of Aava- a tiger that remains in the city itself.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:30.140
The two outside are cursed with a dark aura

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:33.300
and one has to wonder whether they became this way

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:35.420
due to the presence of Alsanna.

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:39.380
For they are kept out of sight where none would report on their true nature

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:43.600
or what the child of Dark was doing those who stood beside her.

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:49.860
Inevitably, there came a moment where the Ivory King sensed the degradation of his own soul.

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:52.220
In this moment, he made a decision.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.200
He would not run from Chaos.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:56.660
Rather, he would give himself to Chaos

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:58.680
in order to appease the Flame.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.820
Without a word, he left his home, he left his wife

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:03.540
and he left his country

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:05.940
but not without one final act.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:09.340
For before he set off to strike at the heart of Chaos

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:11.940
he entrusted everything to Alsanna.

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:15.520
Upon his parting, he handed her Eleum Loyce-

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:19.600
the city and a ceremonial blade by its namesake.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:25.040
The twin blades of Eleum Loyce, one light and one dark, were entwined

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:29.100
as the Ivory King and his Dark Queen once were.

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:33.480
He knew Alsanna was a child of Dark all along, but he said nothing.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:36.560
He believed her to be more than the sum of her parts

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.320
and so she was.

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:42.640
The King's belief in the Queen allowed her to rise above her dark nature.

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:45.200
It was his final gift to her.

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:48.680
But then he left, never to return.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:53.180
(Alsanna) Inevitably, the King was drained of vigor

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:57.280
and plunged into the Chaos' heart.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:08:02.080
Eleum Loyce was frozen in time...

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.800
Its leader lost...

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:10.140
I remain here to contain the Chaos,

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:13.900
honoring my Lord's wishes.

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:19.280
Though I am yet to know your name, stranger...

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:23.260
... Will you lend me your strength?

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:27.780
I have but one wish...

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:35.200
That my dear Lord might be freed from that unspeakable Chaos.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:39.220
Many of Eleum Loyce's faithful knights

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:43.600
followed their Lord into the Chaos.

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:49.800
The King's dutiful subjects waited patiently for his homecoming...

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:54.100
But it was too long a wait to bear...

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:59.940
The knights, reborn, will follow your word.

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:04.460
The path to Chaos is now open...

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:06.580
And please...

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:08.620
Do all you can....

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.700
(Vaati) Chaos claimed the Ivory King

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:13.720
and many knights of Loyce.

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:15.820
Many were burned along with their Lord

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:17.820
and to this day, they burn in agony

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:20.160
alongside their once proud King-

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:22.160
lacking all sense of self

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:25.900
and driven only to expunge those who might disturb the Flame

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:27.920
even former compatriots.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:30.600
But those who survived fight with us now-

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:33.460
commanded to strike down their former comrades

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:34.820
and their own King.

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:38.540
Their sacrifice is total and they freeze the portals

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:41.340
so that we may face Chaos' new champion.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:43.520
What makes a king?

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:47.540
Some say that it is birthright while others call it destiny.

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:49.380
Perhaps, it is not important

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:52.540
as long as the King's name serves to unite his people.

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:56.120
The Ivory King was the greatest king we have seen so far.

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:58.720
His sacrifice saved the world from Chaos

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:01.660
and he was not changed by the child of Dark by his side.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:05.740
In fact, she alone remains despite her fearful nature

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:08.940
and watches over Chaos out of respect for her Lord.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:11.420
Such was his influence over her.

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:15.700
For Alsanna, we free the Ivory King's soul from the grip of Chaos.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:22.100
(Alsanna) You've granted my one wish...

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:25.820
My dear Lord has departed...

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:30.480
Now, I have no regrets...

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:35.240
I was born amidst the Dark...

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:39.580
Long ago in the depths of the Abyss

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:42.880
my father perished...

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:46.900
The Dark shattered into tiny pieces

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:50.340
one of which was me...

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:53.340
How frightful I was...

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:59.740
A frail thing, born from but a splinter of Dark...

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:05.920
I felt that I might simply disappear...

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:14.240
I am in fact the incarnation of my father's fears.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:19.480
I saw that the King of this land was strong...

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:27.220
I sought him out to sustain myself, to smother my fears...

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:34.660
Now, I realize that he may have known all along...

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:41.660
I was born of fear and my Lord provided comfort...

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:49.880
And so here I remain, erst to my Lord's wishes...

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:55.100
Watching over Chaos

00:11:55.100 --> 00:12:00.080
until the end of time...

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:06.520
My father, once human, succumbed to Dark

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:12.940
and later set in motion its raging advance...

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:18.580
The Dark wanders, guided by its thirst for souls...

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:21.500
But perhaps...

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:26.020
Man is no different...

